========================================================================
Third-Party Components
========================================================================

This distribution includes third-party open-source components under their
own licenses. Infrastructure libraries are vendored under lib/; optional
bricks are fetched on demand via CMake FetchContent (cmake/dep_fetch.cmake)
unless a local lib/<Name> checkout is present.

mini_tree does NOT vendor or distribute any commercial closed-source stack.

Full license texts are in each component's directory (LICENSE / COPYING).
A catalog with acknowledgements is in docs/ecosystem.md.

